{"id":"aparentemente","lemma":"aparentemente","pos":"adv","rank":1442,"glosses":["apparently","seemingly"],"ipa":"/apaˌɾenteˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-aparentemente.wav","examples":[{"text":"El lugar está aparentemente desierto.","en":"The place is apparently deserted.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804132","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"desert"}]},{"text":"Aparentemente, no hay nada que no pueda pasar hoy.","en":"Apparently, there is nothing that cannot happen today.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691616","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to pass"},{"g":"today, tonight"}]},{"text":"El peligro aparentemente ha terminado.","en":"The danger is apparently over.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"danger, peril"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"finished"}]},{"text":"Aparentemente ella había sido rica.","en":"She appears to have been rich.","words":[null,{"g":"she"},{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"fenugreek"}]},{"text":"A veces suceden cosas aparentemente imposibles.","en":"Seemingly impossible things sometimes happen.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to happen","l":"suceder"},{"g":"thing","l":"cosa"},null,{"g":"impossible","l":"imposible"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"sometimes"]]}]}